Design decision: `applyLocalTrimFallback({int? pass})` performs the trim, fires `hooks.onPass` (local-trim receipt) and `hooks.onDone(pass, tokensAfter)` on success — miroring `_runPass`'s trim branch exactly (it fires onPass then onDone) — and returns whether the trim was applied. The factory's timeout branch then:

```dart
